data: {"id": "2eacc5ec38ef4790-thinking-parallel_evidence-1798", "run_id": "2eacc5ec38ef4790", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到关键事实，先整理冲突与缺口：\n\n### 已确认事实\n1. **Pod 状态矛盾**：\n   - `phase: Running`，但 `Ready=False`、`ContainersReady=False`，container `app` 的 `reason=Error`，`exitCode=137`。\n   - 事件 `Killing: Stopping container app` 在 25m 前触发。\n2. **Terminating 状态确认**：\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-11T03:47:07Z`，`deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`（即请求立即删除）。\n   - **终值符（finalizer）**：`aiops.lab/hold`，这是 Pod 不会消失的直接原因。\n3. **Prometheus 验证**：`kube_pod_deletion_timestamp` 返回了时间戳 `1789098427`（对应 `2026-09-11T03:47:07Z`），确认 Kubernetes API ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789099960548, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

